  "reviewed_runtime_boundaries": [
    "World 4 frozen difficulties use direct level 42, 67, 72, 81 and 90 public values derived from the committed version-4.4 template and hard-level inputs.",
    "Banishing Punch deals 300% ATK Physical damage; Burning Beam deals 300% ATK Physical damage and delays the target action by 50%.",
    "Power Amplification permanently adds a stackable 15% ordinary-damage boost to all allied units.",
    "Emergency Support creates four independent support slots; each slot chooses the Automaton Beetle or Automaton Hound role once through authoritative behavior-choice RNG and retains the exact 300% or 250% ATK action.",
    "Tactical Support creates two Automaton Direwolves, each with the exact 250% ATK Disintegration Order action.",
    "Oversaturated Bombardment emits twelve explicit 15% ATK Physical hits and then applies a stackable three-turn 20% DEF reduction with a 100% base chance.",
    "Boost Deployment creates one Auxiliary Robot Arm; Oppressive Embrace deals 50% of target maximum HP and applies Restrained, and Disabling Field deals 50% of the restrained target maximum HP.",
    "The arm enters Overload Warning after three linked-unit turns or immediately below 50% current HP, releases Restrained targets, advances Svarog by 100%, then uses 1500% ATK Controlled Blasting and despawns on its next action.",
    "All three phase rotations, random support roles, linked-unit lifecycles, current-HP overload branch, action control and effect stacking use shared Rule IR without a native handler."
